  <text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
    <body>

        <div xml:id="AN219.1-kilavi">
          <p type="edition">makaṭpōkkiya tāy colliyatu.</p>
          <p type="translation" xml:lang="en">What the mother said who had let [her] daughter go.</p>
        </div>
        <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="AN219.1">
        <l>cīrkeḻu viyaṉakarc cilampunaka viyali</l>
        <l>yōrai yāyamoṭu pantuciṟi teṟiyiṉum</l>
        <l>vārā yōveṉ ṟētta pērilaip</l>
        <l>pakaṉṟai vāṉmalar paṉiniṟain tatupōṟ</l>
        <l>pālpey vaḷḷañ cālkaip peṟṟi</l>
        <l>yeṉpā ṭuṇṭaṉai yāyi ṉorukā</l>
        <l>ṉuntai pāṭu muṇṇeṉ ṟūṭṭip</l>
        <l>piṟantataṟ koṉṟu ciṟantavai yeytiyā</l>
        <l>ṉalampuṉain teṭuttaveṉ polantoṭik kuṟumaka</l>
        <l>ḷaṟaṉi lāḷaṉō ṭiṟan<supplied>ta</supplied>ṉa <supplied>ḷi</supplied>ṉiyeṉa</l>
        <l><anchor n="1"/>maṟaintamain tīrā neñca nōvēṉ</l>
        <l>poṉvārn taṉṉa viralvā leyiṟṟuc</l>
        <l>cennāy verīiya pukaruḻai yorut<supplied>ta</supplied>l </l>
        <l>poriyarai viḷaviṉ puṉpuṟa viḻaipuḻa</l>
        <l>laḻaleṟi kōṭai tūkkaliṟ kōvalar</l>
        <l>kuḻaleṉa niṉaiyu nīri ṉīḷiṭai</l>
        <l>maṭattakai meliyac cāay</l>
        <l>naṭakkuṅ kolleṉa nōval yāṉē.</l>
      </lg>
      <lg type="translation" xml:lang="en">
        <l corresp="10d">Thinking that (10d)</l>
        <l corresp="9">my gold-bangled little girl whom I raised adorned with beauty,</l>
        <l corresp="8">keeping the special [ritual occasions] corresponding to being born,</l>
        <l corresp="3bc">saying coaxingly,</l>
        <l corresp="1">even when she was advancing in the excellent vast mansion so that [her] anklets sparkled</l>
        <l corresp="2">[or] throwing the ball a bit with [her] companions in the ōrai[game],</l>
        <l corresp="3a" rend="indent3">“won’t you come?”,</l>
        <l corresp="7d">feeding [her],</l>
        <l corresp="5">by means of [my] full hand from a dish in which milk was poured,</l>
        <l corresp="4">resembling a big-leaved white jalap flower filled with dew,</l>
        <l>saying “once you have eaten my share</l>
        <l corresp="6-7c">[now] eat your father’s share too”,</l>
        <l corresp="10">she has gone away now with a virtueless man!”,</l>
        <l corresp="11">my heart that is not affectionate, continually pretending, does not ache.</l>
        <l corresp="18b">Thinking</l>
        <l>“on the waterless long way, where the male of the spotted deer,</l>
        <l>that is frightened of the red dog with finger[-sized] white teeth</l>
        <l>that are like metal [spikes] arranged in rows , thinks, because the west wind</l>
        <l>attacking with fire lifts the coveted tubes from the low back of the woodapple tree</l>
        <l corresp="12-16">with parched trunk, that it is the flute of the cowherds,</l>
        <l>is she walking, she for whom innocence would be befitting,</l>
        <l corresp="17f">exhausted so that she becomes weak?”, I feel pain.</l>
      </lg>
        </div>
    </body>
  </text>

